                <note rend="inline" type="source">861a.01/439</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Japanese Chargé</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Saburi</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-10-30"><hi rendition="#italic">October 30,
                        1922</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Under instructions from my Government, I
                    have the honor to inform you that the last detachment of Japanese troops sailed
                    from Vladivostok on October 25th, thus completing the evacuation of the Siberian
                    mainland.</p>
                <p>Accept [etc.]</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sadao Saburi</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
